  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The kit is functional as the standard curve looks good. However, it did not detect any of the either regular or ethanol-extracted serum samples. The spike recovery is below 50%.\nIt appears there is a matrix effect, and the coated antigen may be limited in binding equine serum leptin, as this kit is designed to detect porcine leptin. \n\nBased on these results, we are not confident that this kit can reliably measure leptin in equine serum."
  },
